(Thank you. I will now turn the call back over to Jensen for closing remarks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Jensen Huang -- President and Chief Executive Officer) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Thanks, everyone. We're navigating our supply chain transitions in a challenging macro ) Tj
T*
(environment. In Gaming, our partners and ecosystem are responding to a sudden slowdown in ) Tj
T*
(consumer demand and correcting channel inventory. Still, the fundamentals of gaming are ) Tj
T*
(strong.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We'll get through this over the next few months and go into next year with our new ) Tj
T*
(architecture. I look forward to telling you more about it at GTC next month. In Data Center, ) Tj
T*
(AI, where computers are helping us write software that was impossible before, is driving a ) Tj
T*
(computing revolution and transforming every industry. NVIDIA's leadership in full-stack data ) Tj
T*
(center scale accelerated computing has made us the ideal partner for companies racing to ) Tj
T*
(leverage the power of AI.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Even with the current macroeconomic headwinds, demand for our Data Center products have never ) Tj
T*
(been stronger. The next wave of computing is coming. With AI and 3D graphics advances, ) Tj
T*
(developers will extend the Internet with virtual world overlays that connect to the physical ) Tj
T*
(world. This next evolution of the Internet is called metaverse.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We created Omniverse to connect the digital and physical world and be an open platform for ) Tj
T*
(creating and operating metaverse applications. The immediate applications for Omniverse span ) Tj
T*
(product design, manufacturing and operations. Omniverse is off to a great start. Our ) Tj
T*
(Automotive revenue is inflecting, and we expect it to be our next billion-dollar business.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Autonomous driving is one of the biggest challenges AI can solve, and computing opportunity ) Tj
T*
(for us spans the data center to the car. Autonomous driving will transform the auto industry ) Tj
T*
(into a tech industry. Automotive is one of the first to transform into a software-defined tech) Tj
T*
( industry. But all industries will be.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(We're building NVIDIA AI and NVIDIA Omniverse to be the engines for the world's enterprise to ) Tj
T*
(become software-defined, AI-powered technology companies. I look forward to next month's GTC ) Tj
T*
(conference, where we will share new advances of RTX reinventing 3D graphics in gaming, AI's ) Tj
T*
(continuing breakthroughs and building the metaverse, the next evolution of the Internet. So ) Tj
T*
(join us. We look forward to updating you on our progress next quarter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
